From: yinjiayi <yinjiayi@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Explicitly type original function-test pointer array sentinels

GCC 14 diagnoses the nonzero integer initializers of the original void*
arrays with -Wint-conversion. Use the same explicit pointer view as the
adjacent original tests. Keep every value, NULL constant, operation, case
and assertion unchanged. Do not weaken compiler options or skip tests.

